{"ref":"passive:mini-ghost","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Ghost is a passive item from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Ghost is added to the level up item pool after ",{"t":"Lifesign Scan","r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," reaches level 2. It is consumed upon Lifesign Scan evolving into ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Ghost can be found as a stage item on ",{"t":"Polus Replica","r":"stage:polus-replica"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["C1_SHRINK_GHOSTT"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Ghost?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["3"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Ghost?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Ghost?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Ghost?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[["Polus Replica"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Mini Ghost mirrors the effects of ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"},", acting as a lesser version of the weapon. It also spawns a miniature, non-functional ",{"t":"Ghost Lino","r":"character:ghost-lino"}," that flies around the player's character. Each Mini Ghost level corresponds to the same level for Clock Lancet."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once it is consumed after evolving Lifesign Scan, the Clock Lancet effect disappears, althoug